#: title/pc5_ui.c:7642
msgid ""
"The game is copied once and checked, to the console or, with a USB drive "
"plugged in, to its PC5 folder. Whether a game runs is only known by trying "
"it."
msgstr ""
"El juego se copia una vez y se comprueba, a la consola o, con una unidad "
"USB conectada, a su carpeta PC5. Si un juego funciona solo se sabe "
"probándolo."

