msgstr "Marcar"

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7676
msgid "Install games from the INSTALL folder"
msgstr "Instalar juegos de la carpeta INSTALL"

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7678
msgid ""
"Put each game's folder (the one with its .exe in it) at the top of a USB "
"drive formatted as exFAT, plug the drive into the PS5, then look again."
msgstr ""
"Pon la carpeta de cada juego (la que contiene su .exe) en la raíz de una "
"unidad USB formateada en exFAT, conecta la unidad a la PS5 y vuelve a "
"buscar."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7692
